      "uid": "zhcn:940298de1b6ee3d4c0d12910",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以……今天在看过她的表现之后，\r\n我才会庆幸，还好她没有与我签订合约。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dc4a628381c6818e5c2f9d0da2745bcef1c89f1eff69c95cbf9d0e75c67f7ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
