      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在之前的每一天，我都在担心着她是否有遇上\r\n某位能比我更加理解她的训练员……\r\n今天看见了您……这才让我放下心来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe0034f1c4022624bc17c1425b1e7a1e492d0623a1a5e54600e671d78ad2b9ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
