      "uid": "zhcn:18b0f808fb9c781d463b4819",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "愧疚、烦恼、苦闷——在这些情绪之下，\r\n她仍然选择了尽到她与那位赛马娘的人情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a1e6b6d3c966acd2e3f3441446076028f299aa9ff061bf41ca807cc241ec3ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105306.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
