      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1f1de2efc34ff5c03b2e10b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她不是个坏人。\r\n只是一个……做出了最适合她自己的判断，\r\n再普通不过的训练员而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75eb5c306a05b9cd3e65b9edc7fc644a36ad9a5d21b28a758990c8b369c4083a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
