    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29f8287edfea0ee13e0f3a01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便是我，也难以理解这些话语。\r\n妨碍……\r\n合约的高墙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "061e81940cb7d92b587460ada0b5c9230f6a1cb29e838f28d57ae8bfc170e38b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
