    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:569dfe22efefc7070dee914d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与新宇宙当初签订的训练合约应该不会出什\r\n么问题。\r\n但为什么……",
      "source_fingerprint": "592be05f94ecc8f47a7c2bb6be1404ed4090bb9eafbca8a38c9077c52fa9ac9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
